== 代数式的值

代数式是表示数的计算式子，如果代数式里的字母用指定的数去代替，再依照代数式里所表示的运算进行计算，所得的结果就叫作*代数式的值*。

#example("例 1")[计算代数式 $-3a^2 b$ 的值：\
  (1) 当 $a=-3$，$b=5$；\
  (2) 当 $a=0.1$，$b=8$；\
  (3) 当 $a=3/5$，$b=-mx(8, 1, 3)$。]

#sol[]

#lsol[
$ "(1)" quad -3a^2 b = -3(-3)^2 (5) = -3 dot (+9) dot 5 = -135 class("normal", "；") $

$ "(2)" quad -3a^2 b = -3(0.1)^2 (8) = -3(0.01)(8) = -0.24 class("normal", "；") $

$ "(3)" quad -3a^2 b &= -3(3/5)^2 (-mx(8, 1, 3)) = -3 dot 9/25 dot (-25/3) \
  &= +9 class("normal", "。") $
]

// p.86
#example("例 2")[计算代数式 $2x^3 - 5x^2 + 3x - 8$ 的值：\
  (1) 当 $x=1$；#gap#gap (2) 当 $x=-1$；\
  (3) 当 $x=1/2$；#gap#gap (4) 当 $x=-1/2$。]

#sol[]

#lsol[
$ "(1)" quad 2x^3 - 5x^2 + 3x - 8 &= 2(1)^3 - 5(1)^2 + 3(1) - 8 \
  &= 2 - 5 + 3 - 8 = -8 class("normal", "；") $

$ "(2)" quad 2x^3 - 5x^2 + 3x - 8 &= 2(-1)^3 - 5(-1)^2 + 3(-1) - 8 \
  &= 2(-1) - 5(+1) + 3(-1) - 8 \
  &= -2 - 5 - 3 - 8 = -18 class("normal", "；") $

$ "(3)" quad 2x^3 - 5x^2 + 3x - 8 &= 2(1/2)^3 - 5(1/2)^2 + 3(1/2) - 8 \
  &= 2(1/8) - 5(1/4) + 3(1/2) - 8 \
  &= 1/4 - 5/4 + 3/2 - 8 \
  &= -1 + mx(1, 1, 2) - 8 = -mx(7, 1, 2) class("normal", "；") $

$ "(4)" quad & 2x^3 - 5x^2 + 3x - 8 \
  &= 2(-1/2)^3 - 5(-1/2)^2 + 3(-1/2) - 8 \
  &= 2(-1/8) - 5(+1/4) + 3(-1/2) - 8 \
  &= -1/4 - 5/4 - 3/2 - 8 = -3/2 - 3/2 - 8 = -11 class("normal", "。") $
]

#attention[把字母的指定数值代入代数式后，有些乘方或原来省略乘号的地方，需要添上括号或者乘号。]

#example("例 3")[计算代数式 $3(3a-2b)^2$ 的值：\
  (1) 当 $a=-2$，$b=-3$；#gap (2) 当 $a=-2$，$b=+3$；\
  (3) 当 $a=0.4$，$b=0.3$；#gap (4) 当 $a=-0.4$，$b=-0.3$。]

// p.87
#sol[]

#lsol[
$ "(1)" quad 3(3a-2b)^2 &= 3[3(-2) - 2(-3)]^2 \
  &= 3(-6+6)^2 = 3 dot 0^2 = 0 class("normal", "；") $

$ "(2)" quad 3(3a-2b)^2 &= 3[3(-2) - 2(+3)]^2 \
  &= 3(-6-6)^2 = 3(-12)^2 \
  &= 3(+144) = 432 class("normal", "；") $

$ "(3)" quad 3(3a-2b)^2 &= 3[3(0.4) - 2(0.3)]^2 \
  &= 3(1.2-0.6)^2 = 3(0.6)^2 \
  &= 3 times 0.36 = 1.08 class("normal", "；") $

$ "(4)" quad 3(3a-2b)^2 &= 3[3(-0.4) - 2(-0.3)]^2 \
  &= 3(-1.2+0.6)^2 = 3(-0.6)^2 \
  &= 3 times 0.36 = 1.08 class("normal", "。") $
]

#example("例 4")[计算代数式 $(a+2b)/(2a+b)$ 的值：\
  (1) 当 $a=1/2$，$b=-1/3$；#gap (2) 当 $a=-mx(1, 1, 2)$，$b=mx(1, 2, 3)$；\
  (3) 当 $a=-1/3$，$b=0.3$；#gap (4) 当 $a=-1.3$，$b=-1.5$。]

#sol[]

#lsol[
$ "(1)" quad (a+2b)/(2a+b) = (1/2 + 2(-1/3)) / (2(1/2) + (-1/3)) = ((1/2 - 2/3) times 6) / ((1 - 1/3) times 6) \
  = (3-4)/(6-2) = -1/4 class("normal", "；") $

$ "(2)" quad (a+2b)/(2a+b) = (-mx(1, 1, 2) + 2(mx(1, 2, 3))) / (2(-mx(1, 1, 2)) + (mx(1, 2, 3))) = (-3/2 + 10/3) / (-3 + 5/3) \
  = (-9+20)/(-18+10) = 11/(-8) = -mx(1, 3, 8) class("normal", "；") $

// p.88
$ "(3)" quad (a+2b)/(2a+b) = (-1/3 + 2(0.3)) / (2(-1/3) + 0.3) = (-1/3 + 0.6) / (-2/3 + 0.3) \
  = (-1/3 + 3/5) / (-2/3 + 3/10) = (-10+18)/(-20+9) = (+8)/(-11) = -8/11 class("normal", "；") $

$ "(4)" quad (a+2b)/(2a+b) = (-1.3 + 2(-1.5)) / (2(-1.3) + (-1.5)) = (-1.3-3)/(-2.6-1.5) \
  = (-4.3)/(-4.1) = 43/41 = mx(1, 2, 41) class("normal", "。") $
]

#example("例 5")[计算代数式 $-a^2$ 与 $(-a)^2$ 的值：\
  (1) $a=5$，#gap (2) $a=-5$，#gap (3) $a=0.13$，\
  (4) $a=-0.13$，#gap#gap (5) $a=-mx(1, 2, 3)$。]

#sol[]

#lsol[
$ "(1)" quad & -a^2 = -5^2 = -25 class("normal", "，") \
  & (-a)^2 = (-5)^2 = +25 class("normal", "；") $

$ "(2)" quad & -a^2 = -(-5)^2 = -25 class("normal", "，") \
  & (-a)^2 = [-(-5)]^2 = 5^2 = 25 class("normal", "；") $

$ "(3)" quad & -a^2 = -(0.13)^2 = -0.0169 class("normal", "，") \
  & (-a)^2 = (-0.13)^2 = +0.0169 class("normal", "；") $

$ "(4)" quad & -a^2 = -(-0.13)^2 = -0.0169 class("normal", "，") \
  & (-a)^2 = [-(-0.13)]^2 = (0.13)^2 = 0.0169 class("normal", "；") $

$ "(5)" quad & -a^2 = -(-mx(1, 2, 3))^2 = -(-5/3)^2 = -25/9 = -mx(2, 7, 9) class("normal", "，") \
  & (-a)^2 = [-(-mx(1, 2, 3))]^2 = (5/3)^2 = 25/9 = mx(2, 7, 9) class("normal", "。") $
]

#attention[$-a^2$ 要先平方再添上负号，$(-a)^2$ 要先添上负号，再行平方。]

